at times, it will be the only way to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE YOUR SHIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you progress through the levels, you will unlock the rotating shield, which you can use to protect yourself from projectiles if you orient it towards them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.poster.avif?t=1765374638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.webm?t=1765374638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.mp4?t=1765374638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Neon Dodge</strong> is a challenge, which is why we've decided to kindly remind you how many times you've died already. (Yes, there's an achievement for a no dying run)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/496801a065c07d0de1eff86a0e7ce8fa.webp?t=1765374638\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/496801a065c07d0de1eff86a0e7ce8fa.poster.avif?t=1765374638\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mavixen"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/129cd38b950db98f228a2232b4a9b3466fca78be/header.jpg?t=1765374638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"mov